---
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
permalink: /writing/
description: Essays by zorvan — cryptography, coordination, accountability, and the philosophy of delegated action. Synced from Medium.
---
<div class="page-intro">
  <p class="kicker">The notebook</p>
  <h1>Writing</h1>
  <p>
    Essays where the cryptography meets the critique — on delegated action, coordination,
    portable proof, and the impossibility of writing. Kept on Medium; mirrored here as it appears.
  </p>
</div>

{% if writing.length %}
<ol class="entries">
  {%- for post in writing %}
  <li class="entry">
    <div class="meta">
      <span class="n">№ {{ (writing.length - loop.index0) | folio }}</span><br>
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ post.title }}</a></h3>
      {% if post.subtitle %}<p class="sub">{{ post.subtitle }}</p>{% endif %}
      {% if post.excerpt %}<p class="ex">{{ post.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
      {%- if post.tags.length %}
      <p class="tags">{% for t in post.tags %}<span class="tag">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</p>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ol>
<p style="margin-top:2.4rem"><a class="more" href="https://medium.com/@zorvan">continue on Medium</a></p>
{% else %}
<p class="muted">
  The feed could not be reached at build time. Read everything directly at
  <a href="https://medium.com/@zorvan">medium.com/@zorvan</a>.
</p>
{% endif %}
